# Build context for the Dockerfile (the full app: UI, agent, engine, MCP launcher). Allowlist: start from nothing,
# then let in only what the Dockerfile copies. Everything else stays out, including .env, .git, .venv, .claude,
# data/raw/ (708 MB of CSVs), every *.duckdb except the two checked-in ones, docs/, tests/ and every run other than
# the canonical ones. runs/hhf-final-3/ is the Dockerfile's default CANONICAL_RUN; runs/hhf-final/ is an earlier superseded run.
*

!requirements-live.txt
!.streamlit/config.toml
!agent/
!engine/
!etl/
!graph/
!mcp/
!ops/
!policy/
!rag/
!schema_engine/
!contracts/
!ui/
!cases/
!data/
!runs/hhf-final-3/
!runs/hhf-final/
!runs/live-final-2/

data/raw/
data/out/
data/out_delta/
data/backup/
data/corpus/raw/
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite-journal
**/*.duckdb
**/*.wal
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.DS_Store
ui/principals.json

# the facts snapshot (base + January) and the validator's ids: both checked in, both read by a live run
!data/hhgoa_engine.duckdb
!data/ids.duckdb
